    "updated_at": "2016-01-21T09:50:56Z",
    "body": "Some interesting finds in httparchive:\n\n```\n<template class=\"js_globalmessage\"> <div class=\"globalmessage {{type}}\"> <div class=\"messagecontainer\"> {{message}} {{#if closable}} <button type=\"button\" class=\"close js_close\">&#x2a09;</button> {{/if}} </div> </div> </template>    \n```\n\nHmm... Having `{{#if foo}}` etc as text makes it hard to check content models, e.g. in an `ul`... And this won't work inside e.g. tables. Maybe it would be better to use nested `template` elements?:\n\n```\n<template class=\"js_globalmessage\">\n <div class=\"globalmessage {{type}}\">\n  <div class=\"messagecontainer\">\n   {{message}} \n   <template data-if=\"closable\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"close js_close\">&#x2a09;</button>\n   </template>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</template>\n```\n\n(Maybe the `template` element should allow any attribute, like `embed`, so you can do `if=\"...\"` etc?)\n\n```\n...  <img src=\"{2}\" width=\"44\" height=\"33\"> ...\n... <img id=\"topcmm-123flashchat-common-userlist-richer-img\" src=\"\"/> ...\n```\n\n`{2}` here is probably supposed to be replaced when using the template, as well as filling in the empty `src` attribute. Since there's no standard syntax for this, maybe attribute values should be \"anything goes\".\n\n```\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"table-layout: fixed;\" class=\"topcmm-123flashchat-common-list-table\"> <thead> <tr> </tr> </thead> </table>\n```\n\nNo cells should be allowed. Obsolete attributes should not.\n\n```\n<span class=\"topcmm-123flashchat-common-chat-panel-single-box-time-text-color topcmm-123flashchat-common-message-float-left\" speaker_style> <div> ...\n```\n\n`speaker_style` should still be invalid; `div` in `span` should also be invalid.\n\n> Error: Duplicate ID topcmm-123flashchat-buy-credits-panel-pay-type-box-btn-{0}.\n\nAllow this...\n\n> Error: Element marquee not allowed as child of element template in this context.\n\nObsolete elements should not be allowed.\n\nAlso the validator shouldn't warn about empty elements e.g. `h1`\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
