    "updated_at": "2016-01-21T14:16:00Z",
    "body": "I agree w/ everything stated and especially w/ the bit about empty elements. That one is a personal pet peeve of mine. When I used to validate I used to scream at the validator for the long list of warnings about empty elements and errors about missing or malformed attributes that it spat out. It was during one of those scream-fests that I realized that validation wasn't worth it. So I am really quite delighted that there is a chance something will be done about it.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
