    "body": "Howdy. Just chiming in here for now to say I fully support making spec changes here to align better with real-world author-developer needs. Implementing changes in the HTML checker behavior for it could end up being some significant work but worth it if the end result is something that people actually keep using (and like to use) rather than something they don’t use (or don’t like to use) due to annoyance caused by excessive message about non-problems.\n",
